      "content": "\"let myself rest\"... i guess. but it feels like even when i'm sleeping i'm just waiting for the alarm to go off so the cycle starts again. it's not just being tired. it's like a deep, heavy weight. i look at my life and i see all these achievements and i just think... what was the point? i've spent my whole life building this career and i've never felt more hollow. it's like i'm just existing in a loop that never ends.",
